      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这种情况，是因为当分子彼此非常靠近时，分子间就相互排",
        "斥. 这种相互排斥的存在可以由许多现象中看出. 如一个被",
        "压缩的物体可以重新舒展开来，就是因为被压缩时它的分子",
        "就彼此靠近，从而产生了相互排斥的作用."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为什么固体和液体不自行离散成为一群独立的单个",
        "分子？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在什么条件下分子间的吸引作用显著？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "3",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为什么两段粉笔在压挤下也不能结合在一起，而两",
        "块油灰或两块铅就可以？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "4",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "哪些现象可以说明，分子间不仅相互吸引，也相互",
        "排斥？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
